Subject: [PATCH 1/2] hid: add suspend/resume hooks for hid drivers
Message-ID: <20100425214003.7e87c6a3@neptune.home>
X-Mailer: Claws Mail 3.7.5 (GTK+ 2.18.6; i686-pc-linux-gnu)
Mime-Version: 1.0
